  "Left English on purpose: NPC_NAMES (20) + ARENA_SURNAMES (12) bot/NPC names (24438, 24510); 'You' default player name (24515, used as a name); needLogin() 24434-24435 (dead code, no callers); acctSwitchReload/sign-in reload overlay 24421-24430 (bodies of functions that start in the off-limits sign-in range).",
  "Rankings 'YOU' marker: jumpToMe found your row by /YOU/.test(textContent); now the row carries <span data-rkme> and the lookup uses querySelector('[data-rkme]') (24553, 24572).",
  "rankTier() name is now the full 'Gold Rank' label (only shown in the arena podium; the ' Rank' suffix was dropped there).",
  "ARENA_SHOP name/desc became getters so they read the language when the shop is drawn (the array is built at load).",
  "tests/test_witch_client_rid.js runs renderCauldron in a vm whose context has no t/ewT - renderCauldron now calls t() (Loading cauldron, labels), so the test needs t:()=>'' and ewT in its ctx or it throws ReferenceError.",
  "tests/test_arena_sweep_1097.js line 59 asserts the page source literal Buy +1 &middot; ${att.extraCostGems|0} diamonds (regex) - now t('arena.buy_attempt',{n:att.extraCostGems|0}); needs updating to the t() call.",
  "tests/witches-hut-browser.test.js 83/85/86/339 assert rendered English text (Cauldron · Hut Lv, Heal All · strongest first) - still true in English.",
  "No other tests/ hits for the converted literals."
